@startuml state-pickup-code
title State Diagram(Pickup Code Lifecycle)

' Source: ERD.md and backend-state-machines.md.

state "active" as Active
state "used" as Used
state "expired" as Expired
state "revoked" as Revoked

[*] --> Active : issue pickup code
Active --> Used : confirm handover
Active --> Expired : reach expiry time
Active --> Revoked : revoke pickup code
Used --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]

note right of Used
  A used code is retained for the handover audit record.
end note

@enduml
